                                                                        <tr>
                                        <td style="padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;word-break: break-word">I would like to express my concern regarding this lecturer’s teaching methods. Throughout the course, the classes were conducted only online and were extremely short, often lasting no more than 9 minutes. In addition, the lectures were delivered in Indonesian rather than English. During these sessions, the lecturer simply read the PowerPoint slides without providing any further explanation or meaningful interaction, and then ended the class.
Furthermore, I believe the grading was unfair. I completed all the required assignments and quizzes, yet the grade I received does not reflect my effort or performance.
I hope that in the future, the teaching approach can be improved and that the grading system will be more transparent and fair.</td>
